# Bhairavi lehra, Teentaal (16 matras, 4 vibhags of 4)
# Bhairavi thaat: komal re ga dha ni; shuddha Ma, Pa. Sam beat 1, khaali beat 9.
# Ascends S r g m P .. to taar Sa, then descends back to m -> resolves to S at sam.
# Grammar: newline or '|' separates vibhags; ' = taar, . = mandra; ',' splits a
#          matra; '-' sustains.
#
#  Sa re ga Ma
S r g m
#  Pa Ma ga re
P m g r
#  Pa dha ni Sa'   (khaali at Pa / beat 9)
P d n S'
#  ni dha Pa Ma
n d P m
